.TH NN-SPARSITY 1 "2026" "nn 0.1.0" "NN Manual"
.SH NAME
nn-sparsity \- weight sparsity and prune-candidate hints
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B nn sparsity [options] <model>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Count zeros and near-zeros, join weights to layers, and rank conv/dense channels with small L1 against MAC share. Inspect only; does not rewrite the graph. Estimated savings are an upper bound.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-threshold VALUE
Absolute |w| near-zero threshold (default 0).
.TP
.B \-\-channel\-frac VALUE
Weak if channel L1 <= VALUE times the layer max (default 0.01).
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 success.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
nn sparsity model.onnx --threshold 1e-6
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
nn-quant(1), nn-tensors(1), nn-compute(1)
